OL,3,GNEWSAThomas Telford mural champions
OL,4,Awharf's role in Industrial Revolution
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wharf in Shropshire dating back
OL,7,Fnearly 200 years "played a key part in
OL,8,Faccelerating the Industrial
OL,9,FRevolution", according to a group
OL,10,Frestoring it.
OL,12,FNow a mural has been unveiled there
OL,13,Fcelebrating the county's canal heritage
OL,14,F- paying homage to 19th Century
OL,15,Fengineer Thomas Telford and marking the
OL,16,Frole of the site near the town that was
OL,17,Fnamed after him.
OL,19,F"Wappenshall Wharf was definitely a
OL,20,Fbustling place in its heyday with goods
OL,21,Fcoming by water and road," volunteer
OL,22,FAlan Harding said.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
